<title>USA: MOTOROLA NAMES NEW SUBSCRIBER SECTOR PRESIDENT.</title>
<headline>MOTOROLA NAMES NEW SUBSCRIBER SECTOR PRESIDENT.</headline>
<dateline>LIBERTYVILLE, Ill. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Motorola Inc said Monday Fred Kuznik, senior vice president, was named president of the cellular subscriber sector, replacing Robert Weisshappel, who will retire at the end of the year after 27 years of service.</p>
<p>Kuznik had been serving as general manager of the Cellular Subscriber Sector in Europe, the Middle East and Africa prior to his elevation, the company said. Weisshappel will continue on as an adviser to Motorola.</p>
<p>Motorola shares were down 1-6/16 at 78-13/16 Monday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
